' Aus test_tuple.py uebertragen (30 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-07). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== tuple literal (1)
DIM t AS TUPLE
t = (1, 2, 3)
PRINT t
--- erwartet
(1, 2, 3)

=== tuple literal (2)
DIM t AS TUPLE
t = (1, 2, 3)
PRINT t
--- erwartet
(1, 2, 3)

=== tuple with mixed types (1)
DIM t AS TUPLE
t = (42, "hi", TRUE, 3.5)
PRINT t
--- erwartet
(42, hi, TRUE, 3.5)

=== tuple with mixed types (2)
DIM t AS TUPLE
t = (42, "hi", TRUE, 3.5)
PRINT t
--- erwartet
(42, hi, TRUE, 3.5)

=== single paren is grouping not tuple (1)
' `(5)` bleibt eine normale Klammer-Gruppierung, kein 1-Tupel.
DIM x AS INTEGER
x = (5)
PRINT x
--- erwartet
5

=== single paren is grouping not tuple (2)
' `(5)` bleibt eine normale Klammer-Gruppierung, kein 1-Tupel.
DIM x AS INTEGER
x = (5)
PRINT x
--- erwartet
5

